            "review_title": "Review at Buffet Hải Sản Nha Trang Mr Mộc",
            "review_text": "Татьяна\nNha Trang, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\n👎🏼\nAug 2026 • Couples\nDecided to visit this buffet with my boyfriend, but we were not very satisfied. At the entrance, they didn't want to give us change, thinking they would keep it as a tip. I almost had to take it away. Then, when we went to the gym, all the spots were taken. The choice of dishes is certainly large if you don't care what to eat, as it seemed to us that the focus here is on Vietnamese and Korean guests.\nReady-made cold dishes, those that do not need to be salted. For its price, you can only get unlimited drinks here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten September 27, 2026",
