            "review_text": "Валерий Б\nMoscow, Russia9 contributions\n0\nBest of the three Nha Trang buffets\nMay 2026 • Couples\nGreat for seafood lovers. You can grill and steal samovar. Seafood is freshest, constantly replenishing (the LOTTE shopping mall has empty plates in the buffet). Better bring the liquor with you. Beer is included in the price, but it's warm and not delicious. Repeat, seafood buffet. Everyone else (vegetarian and sympathizer) - MIMO!!!\nPRICE PER PERSON 365 VND. And yes, it's a bucket for self-cooked enthusiasts. Before paying, you can go and watch the whole buffet and decide to stay or not .\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten May 23, 2026",
