            "review_text": "Vinh N\n3 contributions\n0\nStaffs ok, but ..\nNov 2025 • Family\nPros: \nServices: excellent, staffs were helpful and polite\nFood: varieties ok, compared to the price you paid\nCons:\nCleanliness: not quite satisfied, especially at the beverage station.\nFood: not so freshly, no tag on any of it, you have no ideas what you are taking, even the sauces\nEnvironment was noisy and stressful \nCons plus:\nStaff asked to rate 5star “in place”, they even asked for using your phone to do that themselves.\nSome of the food dishes were restricted for hotpot only, which means you shouldn’t take if not you have order one, to get it, either “check in” (meaning leaving a good rating in social media) for a free one, or pay extra for it. \nSummary: improvements needed\nRead more\nWritten November 2, 2025",
